# Implicit-import qmldir for this directory (see build.rs). Before Qt 6.5,
# files here resolve sibling types through the directory rather than the
# ZestBay module, so without this the singletons (Theme, Glyphs) are plain
# types and every lookup on them is undefined. Other types are still found
# as plain files.
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Glyphs 1.0 Glyphs.qml
